 ## Background
-The method is derived from the "ClearView" rendering technique, specifically the "HexMeshUnified" fragment shader implementation, which integrates volume coloring with edge highlighting [S1, unofficial]. It is part of a broader effort to enhance perceptual clarity in volumetric data visualization through non-photorealistic rendering techniques [S1, unofficial]. The implementation uses a Parallel Prefix List List (PPLL) structure for efficient fragment management, a technique common in high-performance graphics applications [S1, unofficial].
